tags: statement-row, statement_row_mu

A rate of the node: the price of one movement in an answer of GetBalanceStatement.

The value is MU for one. Example: 1. The node takes it from the balance that
pays for the action.

The rate has no scope. A reader that does not know the rate ignores it.

=== formal
base=one
class=rate
name=statement-row
of=one movement in a GetBalanceStatement answer, charged to the caller with the query
scope=none
